This site consumes `@keystone-sites/marketing-design-system`. The package's rules are canonical and are not duplicated here. Before changing anything under `site/` or `app/`, read, from `node_modules/@keystone-sites/marketing-design-system/` (source: `../keystone-marketing-design-system`):

1. `AGENTS.md`
2. `rules/design-system.md`
3. `rules/grid-and-layout.md`

Then read this repo's `AGENTS.md` for what is specific to the marketing site. A rule the package needs changes in the package, never as a local override; where the two disagree, the package wins.
